From addc167060b68b2b8f904d5f7bf218499bd5b3f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hieu Huynh <hieuh@os.amperecomputing.com>
Date: Thu, 22 May 2025 15:29:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Expose the SMBIOS Type 128 PCIe Device information

This expose the SMBIOS type 128 PCIe Device information to dbus.

Tested:
busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.Smbios.MDR_V2
```
`- /xyz
  `- /xyz/openbmc_project
    |- /xyz/openbmc_project/Smbios
    | `- /xyz/openbmc_project/Smbios/MDR_V2
    `- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory
      `- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system
        `- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/chassis
          `- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/chassis/motherboar
            |- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/chassis/motherboard/pciedevice0
            |- /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/chassis/motherboard/pciedevice1
```

Upstream-Status: Pending

